Plaid blur library — bundled native blur library with corner-radius support

Source: https://github.com/Plyply99/Plaid-rounded-blur
A fork of kancko/gnome-rounded-blur (https://github.com/kancko/gnome-rounded-blur),
which is a standalone copy of gnome-shell's ShellBlurEffect with a corner mask,
exposed as the `Blur` GIR namespace. The fork adds a configurable mutter API
target (build-arg `-Dmutter-api=18` for GNOME 50, `19` for GNOME 51). Built
against the target mutter (see build-blur.sh to rebuild after mutter updates).

License: GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE; derived from gnome-shell's
shell-blur-effect.c, GPL-3).
